AABAD KARBALA HUVI GHAR MERA LUT GAYA,<br>
 ZAINAB HAI BERIDA SARE SHABBIR KAT GAYA<br>
<br>
SHAAM-E-GARIBAA KARTI HAI ZAINAB AJAB FUGAA,<br>
 NALAON SE HIL RAHE HAI ZAMEEN-O-AASMAA,<br>
 HAI HAI HUSSAIN KEH KE JO ROTI HAI NEEM JAA,<br>
 RAN MEIN WAHA TADAP TI HAI LASHEY SHAH-E-ZAMAA<br>
<br>
BEEMAAR EK GHASH MEINPADA HAI DAWA NAHI,<br>
 KAISI DAWA GAREEB KO PANI MILA NAHI,<br>
 SHIDDAT HAI BUKHAAR PA UFF TAK KIYA NAHI,<br>
 SABER HAI SHUKR KARTA HAI LAB PA GILA NAHI<br>
<br>
AAWAZ AAYI GHODAO KE TAPAO KI NAGAHA,<br>
 DEKHA SAWAAR AATA HAI IS SIMT BE TAKAA,<br>
 BAD KAR PUKARI KAUN HAI KYA KAAM HAI YAHA,<br>
 WARIS HAMARE QATL HUVE LUT GAYA MAKAA<br>
<br>
LEKIN BADHAYE GHODEY KO AATA THA WO SAWAR,<br>
 ZAINAB KE PASS ROOK LIYA AAKE RAHWAAR,<br>
 ULTI NAQAB CHEHRE SE UTRA WO SHEHSAWAR,<br>
 BETI KE SAAMNE THE KHADE SHAIR-E-KIRDIGAAR<br>
<br>
PHAILAKE HAAT BAAP SE ZAINAB LIPAT GAYI,<br>
 ROROKE KEHTI THI MERI KISMAT ULAT GAYI,<br>
 BAAQI JOPANJETAN KI NISHHANI THI MIT GAYI,<br>
 BABA MEIN APNE BHAI SE JUNGLE MEIN CHUT GAYI<br>
<br>
ROKAR KAHA ALI NE HO QURBAAN YE PIDAR,<br>
 SO JAO THODI DAIR KE HOTI HAI AB SAHER,<br>
 DARPAISH SUBAH KO HAI TUMHAIN SHAAM KA SAFAR,<br>
 DARBAR MEIN YAZEED JANA HAI NANGEY SAR<br>
